  "configuration_id": "config_043",
  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_036 (validation accuracy 0.5729) is the top performer with pca_n2000 RNA, resnet50 image, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. This experiment tests swapping the image encoder to imagenet_vit_l while keeping pca_n2000 RNA, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. It clarifies whether a more powerful image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) could further improve accuracy, leveraging the strong foundation of config_036's RNA and aggregation choices. This balances exploitation of the current top configuration with exploration of a critical design choice (image encoder)."
}

